91:   <section class="temperament"><span>✺</span><div><b>INSTINCT PROFILE</b><p>${p.brain>.67?'A keen strategist with a curious streak.':p.speed>.67?'Restless and quick to answer a challenge.':p.muscle>.68?'A bold powerhouse who thrives on action.':'An adaptable soul, ready to find its own path.'}</p></div></section><div class="record-line"><span>RECORD <b>${c.wins||0}W — ${Math.max(0,(c.battles||0)-(c.wins||0))}L</b></span><span>AGE <b>${formatAge(c.born)}</b></span></div>`
